 "summary": "Three single Schottky barrier diodes in the SOD-323 surface-mount package, rated 350 mA average forward current and told apart by reverse voltage: 40 V (SD103AWS), 30 V (SD103BWS) and 20 V (SD103CWS). Forward drop is at most 0.37 V at 20 mA and 0.60 V at 200 mA. Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters and signal circuits, freewheeling and polarity protection. SD103AWS is the 40 V part.",
